    "details": {
      "biography": {
        "value": "<div class=\"statblock npc rules-2024\"><h4 class=\"statblock-title\">@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e-collection-2024.phb-creatures.Actor.Q0JpORoOcnJx0Vnf]{天空野兽}</h4><p><span class=\"statblock-tags\">小型野兽，绝对中立</span></p><div class=\"statblock-header\"><div class=\"half-width\"><p><strong>AC</strong> 13 + 你的感知调整值<br /><strong>HP</strong> 4 + 你游侠等级的四倍（野兽拥有与你游侠等级相同数量的 d6 生命骰）<br /><strong>速度</strong> 10 尺，飞行 60 尺</p></div><div class=\"abilities\"><table><thead><tr><th scope=\"col\" class=\"visually-hidden\"></th><th scope=\"col\" class=\"visually-hidden\"></th><th scope=\"col\">调整</th><th scope=\"col\">豁免</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope=\"row\">力量</th><td class=\"score\">6</td><td>−2</td><td>−2</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">智力</th><td class=\"score\">8</td><td>−1</td><td>−1</td></tr></tbody></table><table><thead><tr><th scope=\"col\" class=\"visually-hidden\"></th><th scope=\"col\" class=\"visually-hidden\"></th><th scope=\"col\">调整</th><th scope=\"col\">豁免</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope=\"row\">敏捷</th><td class=\"score\">16</td><td>+3</td><td>+3</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">感知</th><td class=\"score\">14</td><td>+2</td><td>+2</td></tr></tbody></table><table><thead><tr><th scope=\"col\" class=\"visually-hidden\"></th><th scope=\"col\" class=\"visually-hidden\"></th><th scope=\"col\">调整</th><th scope=\"col\">豁免</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope=\"row\">体质</th><td class=\"score\">13</td><td>+1</td><td>+1</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">魅力</th><td class=\"score\">11</td><td>+0</td><td>+0</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class=\"half-width\"><p><strong>感官</strong> 黑暗视觉 60 尺，被动察觉 12<br /><strong>语言</strong> 理解你说的语言<br /><strong>CR</strong> 无（XP 0；PB 等同于你的熟练加值）</p></div></div><h5 class=\"statblock-actions-title\">特质</h5><p><em><strong>飞掠。</strong></em>野兽以飞行离开敌人的触及范围时不会引发对方的借机攻击。</p><p><em><strong>原初联结。</strong></em>将你的熟练加值加到野兽进行的一切属性检定和豁免检定上。</p><h5 class=\"statblock-actions-title\">动作</h5><p><em><strong>野兽打击。</strong>近战攻击：</em>加值等于你的法术攻击加值，触及 5 尺。<em>命中：</em>1d4 + 3 + 你的感知调整值点挥砍伤害。</p></div>",
        "public": "<div><h4><em>Beast of the Sky</em></h4></div>"
      },
